OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe rain
OL,6,Fclearing east during this evening with
OL,7,Fclear spells and a scattering of
OL,8,Fshowers overnight. Winds turning into
OL,9,Fthe west or northwest and light or
OL,10,Fmoderate.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FMainly dry and bright although
OL,13,Fthere will be a scattering of showers.
OL,14,FFeeling chilly in the moderate to
OL,15,Ffresh northwest winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,18,Fmainly dry and settled spell as high
OL,19,Fpressure dominates. Winds will also be
OL,20,Fmainly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
